WEBVTT

00:00:01.150 --> 00:00:05.688
Engineers work from 2D drawings
and a 3D model of the same building.

00:00:05.908 --> 00:00:09.116
When the two disagree,
someone has to find every difference.

00:00:09.525 --> 00:00:13.011
Checking each tag and size
by hand takes days.

00:00:13.494 --> 00:00:17.346
AI can read a drawing,
but it can be confidently wrong.

00:00:18.359 --> 00:00:22.097
Iris lets AI read the drawing,
then checks its work.

00:00:22.579 --> 00:00:23.901
Let's try the sample drawings.

00:00:25.148 --> 00:00:26.985
This is sheet M-201,

00:00:27.186 --> 00:00:30.786
the Level 02 mechanical plan
of our sample building, Northbank.

00:00:30.993 --> 00:00:35.831
It's an ordinary PDF, with ducts,
pipes, cable trays and their tags.

00:00:36.840 --> 00:00:40.505
Gemini reads every tag
and every size on the sheet.

00:00:40.910 --> 00:00:44.504
In this sample,
its saved reading replays, at no cost.

00:00:45.564 --> 00:00:47.911
But Iris doesn't just trust the AI.

00:00:48.250 --> 00:00:51.428
Each item is checked
against the PDF's own text layer,

00:00:51.700 --> 00:00:53.622
the exact text inside the file.

00:00:54.467 --> 00:00:58.134
119 of 123 are confirmed.

00:00:58.181 --> 00:01:00.955
Anything not confirmed is marked
for a person to check.

00:01:02.024 --> 00:01:05.676
Then Iris compares the drawings
with the 3D model's own data:

00:01:05.998 --> 00:01:07.996
tags, names and sizes.

00:01:08.001 --> 00:01:10.714
It never asks the AI whether they match.

00:01:11.017 --> 00:01:13.552
On the clean sheet,
nothing differs from the model.

00:01:14.875 --> 00:01:17.315
Now a sheet with four planted mistakes.

00:01:17.687 --> 00:01:19.760
Iris finds exactly those four.

00:01:20.138 --> 00:01:25.878
A duct is 600×250 on the drawing,
but 600×300 in the model.

00:01:26.044 --> 00:01:28.361
A cable tray is missing from the model.

00:01:28.953 --> 00:01:32.744
A duct on the drawing is a Ø42 pipe
in the model.

00:01:32.893 --> 00:01:35.014
And a branch is missing from the drawing.

00:01:36.036 --> 00:01:37.367
AI proposes.

00:01:37.639 --> 00:01:38.800
Geometry proves.

00:01:39.179 --> 00:01:40.885
The engineer decides.

00:01:41.155 --> 00:01:46.522
Iris runs on Google Cloud, with Gemini
on Vertex AI, Cloud Run and Firebase.

00:01:47.147 --> 00:01:48.483
Built by Techjays.
